    <bpmn:process id="W_W5209" name="W5209. Project Material Goods Delivery Receipt (DR) Matching &amp; Verification" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Material delivery to project job site (VS-74); delivery completion
Frequency: Continuous per delivery dispatch
Volume: ~1,500–2,000 deliveries monthly across all projects
Owner: Project Billing Specialist / AR Clerk
Participants: Site Engineer, Fleet Driver (VS-06), 3PL Carrier (VS-56)
Source: workflow W5209 — Project Material Goods Delivery Receipt (DR) Matching &amp; Verification</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5209_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5209_Lane1" name="Project Billing Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5209_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5209_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5209_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5209_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5209_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5209_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5209_Start3" name="Material delivery to project job site (VS-74); delivery completion">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5209_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5209_Task4" name="Receive signed original Goods Delivery Receipts (DR) from returning drivers.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Receive signed original Goods Delivery Receipts (DR) from returning drivers.
Responsible (R): Project Billing Specialist / AR Clerk
Accountable (A): Project Billing Specialist / AR Clerk
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5209_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5209_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5209_Task5" name="Inspect DR: verify contractor site engineer signature, stamp, date, and items…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Inspect DR: verify contractor site engineer signature, stamp, date, and items accepted.
Responsible (R): Project Billing Specialist / AR Clerk
Accountable (A): Project Billing Specialist / AR Clerk
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5209_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5209_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5209_Task6" name="Match DR to ERP billing invoice: verify SKU codes and quantities match.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Match DR to ERP billing invoice: verify SKU codes and quantities match.
Responsible (R): Project Billing Specialist / AR Clerk
Accountable (A): Project Billing Specialist / AR Clerk
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5209_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5209_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5209_Task7" name="Attach scanned copy of signed DR and photo of delivered materials at site…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Attach scanned copy of signed DR and photo of delivered materials at site (GPS-tagged) to ERP invoice record.
Responsible (R): Project Billing Specialist / AR Clerk
Accountable (A): Project Billing Specialist / AR Clerk
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5209_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5209_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5209_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5209_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5209_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-118 (ensure escrow draw &amp; lien-release control.) | - CTL-774: Original signed DR archived; matching verified by AR supervisor before invoicing release.
Owner: Project Billing Specialist / AR Clerk</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
