    <bpmn:process id="W_W5210" name="W5210. Bank Inspector Joint Quantity Survey (JQS) Staging &amp; Schedule Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project materials delivery matching (W5209); scheduled bank inspection date
Frequency: Monthly or bi-weekly depending on contract
Volume: ~100–120 inspections managed monthly
Owner: Project Coordinator / B2B Technical Support
Participants: Bank Inspector, General Contractor Site Engineer, Geodetic Engineer (VS-115)
Source: workflow W5210 — Bank Inspector Joint Quantity Survey (JQS) Staging &amp; Schedule Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5210_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5210_Lane1" name="Project Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5210_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5210_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5210_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5210_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5210_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5210_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5210_Start3" name="Project materials delivery matching (W5209); scheduled bank inspection date">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5210_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5210_Task4" name="Review scheduled inspection dates with the developer and bank escrow agent.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Review scheduled inspection dates with the developer and bank escrow agent.
Responsible (R): Project Coordinator / B2B Technical Support
Accountable (A): Project Coordinator / B2B Technical Support
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5210_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5210_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5210_Task5" name="Compile Joint Quantity Survey (JQS) folder: list all materials delivered…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Compile Joint Quantity Survey (JQS) folder: list all materials delivered, invoices, and matching delivery receipts.
Responsible (R): Project Coordinator / B2B Technical Support
Accountable (A): Project Coordinator / B2B Technical Support
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5210_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5210_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5210_Task6" name="Schedule joint site walk-through with Bank Inspector, Contractor Site Engineer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Schedule joint site walk-through with Bank Inspector, Contractor Site Engineer, and BuildRight representative.
Responsible (R): Project Coordinator / B2B Technical Support
Accountable (A): Project Coordinator / B2B Technical Support
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5210_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5210_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5210_Task7" name="Conduct site audit: inspect delivered materials, measure quantities (lumber…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Conduct site audit: inspect delivered materials, measure quantities (lumber yard, rebar count, tile boxes), and address inspector queries.
Responsible (R): Project Coordinator / B2B Technical Support
Accountable (A): Project Coordinator / B2B Technical Support
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5210_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5210_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5210_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5210_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5210_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-118 (ensure escrow draw &amp; lien-release control.) | - CTL-774: JQS worksheet signed by all three parties (Inspector, Contractor, BuildRight) at site; discrepancies resolved.
Owner: Project Coordinator / B2B Technical Support</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
