    <bpmn:process id="W_W5211" name="W5211. Escrow Draw Request Documentation Assembly &amp; Submission" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Signed JQS worksheets (W5210) and billing invoice matching (W5209)
Frequency: Monthly or bi-weekly
Volume: ~100–120 draw submissions monthly
Owner: B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor
Participants: AR Specialist, Corporate Secretary (VS-36), Developer Accountant
Source: workflow W5211 — Escrow Draw Request Documentation Assembly &amp; Submission</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5211_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5211_Lane1" name="B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5211_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5211_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5211_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5211_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5211_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5211_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5211_Start3" name="Signed JQS worksheets (W5210) and billing invoice matching (W5209)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5211_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5211_Task4" name="Compile the formal Escrow Draw Request package: JQS worksheets, signed DRs, tax…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compile the formal Escrow Draw Request package: JQS worksheets, signed DRs, tax declaration clearance, invoice bills, and progress photos.
Responsible (R): B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor
Accountable (A): B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5211_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5211_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5211_Task5" name="Secure corporate signatures: draft Board Resolution or Secretary&#x27;s Certificate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Secure corporate signatures: draft Board Resolution or Secretary&#x27;s Certificate authorizing the draw sign-off (VS-36).
Responsible (R): B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor
Accountable (A): B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5211_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5211_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5211_Task6" name="Validate banking details: match target wire destination to BuildRight mapped…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Validate banking details: match target wire destination to BuildRight mapped trust account (W5204).
Responsible (R): B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor
Accountable (A): B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5211_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5211_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5211_Task7" name="Submit complete draw request folder to the Bank Escrow Agent through the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Submit complete draw request folder to the Bank Escrow Agent through the integrated portal (W5207).
Responsible (R): B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor
Accountable (A): B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5211_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5211_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5211_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5211_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5211_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-774 (ensure controlled execution — Milestone Inspection, Joint Quantity Survey &amp; Escrow Draw Processing (PA-181.2).) | - CTL-774: Draw package reviewed and signed off by Finance Controller before portal upload.
Owner: B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
