        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5215_Start3" name="Draw request rejection or payment freeze by bank/developer (W5212)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5215_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5215_Task4" name="Analyze dispute basis: review contract clauses, JQS worksheets, and inspector…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Analyze dispute basis: review contract clauses, JQS worksheets, and inspector logs.
Responsible (R): Director of Legal Operations (VS-100) / Credit Manager
Accountable (A): Director of Legal Operations (VS-100) / Credit Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5215_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5215_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5215_Task5" name="Arrange negotiation meetings: coordinate tripartite resolution sessions with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Arrange negotiation meetings: coordinate tripartite resolution sessions with developer, bank agent, and BuildRight legal team.
Responsible (R): Director of Legal Operations (VS-100) / Credit Manager
Accountable (A): Director of Legal Operations (VS-100) / Credit Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5215_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5215_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5215_Task6" name="Develop compromise options: arrange structural corrections, price adjustments…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Develop compromise options: arrange structural corrections, price adjustments, or release of undisputed funds.
Responsible (R): Director of Legal Operations (VS-100) / Credit Manager
Accountable (A): Director of Legal Operations (VS-100) / Credit Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5215_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5215_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5215_Task7" name="Draft formal Settlement Agreement; secure CFO signature and execute adjustments…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Draft formal Settlement Agreement; secure CFO signature and execute adjustments in ERP (credit notes, payment releases).
Responsible (R): Director of Legal Operations (VS-100) / Credit Manager
Accountable (A): Director of Legal Operations (VS-100) / Credit Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5215_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5215_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5215_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5215_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5215_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-774 (ensure controlled execution — Milestone Inspection, Joint Quantity Survey &amp; Escrow Draw Processing (PA-181.2).) | - CTL-774: Settlement agreement signed by CFO; adjustments approved by Controller.
Owner: Director of Legal Operations (VS-100) / Credit Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
