      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly financial close cycle
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: Dashboard monitoring ~100–120 active projects
Owner: Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / B2B Finance Lead
Participants: Credit Manager, Treasury Operations (VS-18), B2B Account Managers
Source: workflow W5216 — Project Progress Billing Status Dashboard &amp; Cashflow Forecast</bpmn:documentation>
