      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5216_Task4" name="Extract project billing and payment data from ERP: compile DSO, aging AR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Extract project billing and payment data from ERP: compile DSO, aging AR, retainage balances, and pending escrow draws.
Responsible (R): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / B2B Finance Lead
Accountable (A): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / B2B Finance Lead
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5216_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5216_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5216_Task5" name="Configure B2B cashflow forecast: estimate project collections based on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Configure B2B cashflow forecast: estimate project collections based on construction milestone schedules.
Responsible (R): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / B2B Finance Lead
Accountable (A): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / B2B Finance Lead
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5216_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5216_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5216_Task6" name="Update the Project Progress Billing Dashboard; highlight branches/projects with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Update the Project Progress Billing Dashboard; highlight branches/projects with high credit risk or payment delays.
Responsible (R): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / B2B Finance Lead
Accountable (A): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / B2B Finance Lead
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5216_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5216_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5216_Task7" name="Distribute dashboard to B2B VP and Treasury; present results at the monthly…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Distribute dashboard to B2B VP and Treasury; present results at the monthly cash committee meeting.
Responsible (R): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / B2B Finance Lead
Accountable (A): Finance FP&amp;A Analyst / B2B Finance Lead
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5216_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5216_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5216_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5216_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
